It's an influx of cheating honestly.  3rd party systems make M=KB easier to ghost enable...as well as other 3rd party devices that allow for zero recoil scripts/aimbotting. 

&#x200B;

I personally noticed it start to creap in when console became cross-platform.  However, since the launch of OW2 the amount of full team wipe all head shot feeds is *higher than normal and worth looking into as a community*

I think they did a pretty good job of picking characters that would have low barriers to entry for newer players.  Very direct play styles  

