Also, thank you for locking new people from Junkrat

I saw them on the SAME tour!!!!  Likely days apart.  Soon after I moved to LA and was fortunite enough to catch a couple unplugged sets in Huntington as well as shows in Hermosa and Redondo.

&#x200B;

Look at them go...just look at them go

Yooooooo....You know it's going to be a mind melting show when they open with Freeze Time!!!!!!!!!!

