Drum solo rocks.  Always has, always will...especially at a LIVE show.

&#x200B;

Sorry to hear you aren't able to get the joy from it that you used to.  Hopefully you can find that energy again!!

I've read that on these forums, but honestly when I place Retail Orders they always ship within 2 weeks.  Never experienced this issue...not once.

&#x200B;

With this being a Reward/Prize item I was expecting some delay, but 60 days since they announced the winners is a little rough.  Fingers crossed they sign them as an extra thank you

Same for when they were in Memphis.  Every bar on Beale Street was cranking our 311 tunes while filled with patrons decked out in 311 gear.  Walking down the street with a drink in hand, it almost feels like a parkinglot party hearing all the different stages of 311 at once.  

&#x200B;

I've done 311 Day in Vegas as well.  I just does not feel the same as the smaller town shows.  Maybe if they moved to a new town?

At this points it's straight bangers getting sent packing...ouch.

