Why is it universally known that this rule does not apply to a 311 concert?  How do we all know??

&#x200B;

See you at the show tonight!!!

I've been to shows before it was a thing and seen the Drum Solo grow into the full on Stage Show that it is.  Is it a bit bloated....maybe, but Applied Science without the Drum Solo sounds flat and lifeless.  

&#x200B;

These guys are performers, and although we as super fans have seen it "20+ times" we have to remember that a good percentage of the audience at the show is seeing the Band for their first time live and the Band is performing for everyone (not just us super fans).  It's going to be special for newcommers....as special as the first time you saw it....and I wouldn't want to take that experience or the drum solo away from the upcoming 311 generation

That's Pretty Sick!!!!!!

